// to_be_bound slots (Merchant + Sponsor), each fully policied (allowedRuntimes + minAssurance A2 +
// authorizedBinder); its binding manifest binds both slots with completeness; a manifest binding only
// one is rejected. See check_multi_slot_binding.py.
